                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "super fun and nostalgic party game!! i used to play this at my friend's house all the time back in 2018 and we always just called it \"the ninja chicken game\" lol (which is why it's nostalgic). i love playing this whenever i have a few more people over than usual and i always suggest chambara (cause it's super fun for parties or hanging out with friends). i love the music, the art style and the core gameplay loop is really fun and entertaining! overall it's an extremely solid party game and i highly recommend it to anyone looking for fun cheap party games!",
